## 4. Deterministic CLI Gates (`PASS` / `FAIL`) & Plan Review Rubric (`BLOCKER` / `MAJOR` / `MINOR`)

### CLI Verification Gates (`PASS` / `FAIL`)

| Gate | Command | Pass Criterion |
|---|---|---|
| **Slice & Contract Validation** | `coder-nexus validate_plan_slices` (or workspace validator) | Reports `PASS` with 100% `AC-NN` coverage and vertical phase ordering |
| **`PHASE-00` Readiness Check** | Workspace readiness probe commands (`[EXECUTE]` rows) | Every probe exits `0` (`PASS`); unresolved external items marked `BLOCKED` |
| **Phase Task Check** | Per-task check command in `phases/PHASE-NN-*.md` | Exits `0` (`PASS`) from the specified `cwd` |

### Plan Review Severity Rubric (`BLOCKER` / `MAJOR` / `MINOR`)

| Severity | Plan Defect Criteria | Required Action Before Gate 3 |
|---|---|---|
| **`BLOCKER`** | Any uncovered `AC-NN` or `BR-NN`; horizontal phase slicing or standalone final test/docs phase (`IP17`); task missing a runnable check command and `cwd` (`IP4`); unpinned spec value defaulted instead of raising `Q-NN` (`IP10`, `IP11`); out-of-workspace edit planned as a `code_writer` task (`IP8`); or arbitrary mid-phase WIP commit tasks / agent-executed production merge or tag tasks (`IP7`, `M6`, `M10`). | Reject plan; fix all `BLOCKER` items before requesting Gate 3 approval. |
| **`MAJOR`** | Unsplit `XL` task or task touching 8+ files / crossing two subsystems without justification (`IP12`); missing `## Global constraints` or `## Review focus` section above `## AC coverage` (`IP10`, `IP11`); transcribed function bodies instead of signatures (`IP16`); or file paths violating `clean-architecture` (`IP3`). | Revise affected tasks/headers before Gate 3 approval. |
| **`MINOR`** | Non-blocking wording ambiguity, minor table formatting, or redundant constraint restatement inside a task. | Clean up in-place during plan finalization. |

